# Vulnerabilities accepted for this repository.
#
# The Security Scan job fails the build on CRITICAL/HIGH findings that have a
# fix available (ignore-unfixed is on). When a finding is genuinely not
# applicable or cannot be actioned yet, record it here with a reason and a date
# so the exception is reviewable rather than invisible.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line.
#
# Example:
#   # CVE-2026-12345 - in a code path this proxy never reaches (reviewed 2026-08-06)
#   CVE-2026-12345
